{"metadata":{"role":"collection","externalID":"GnustoActors","roleHeading":"Framework","title":"GnustoActors","modules":[{"name":"GnustoActors"}],"symbolKind":"module"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors","doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/init()"],"title":"The plugin","anchor":"The-plugin"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:daemonName:rooms:chancePerTurn:while:arrival:departure:)","doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/follows(_:daemonName:rooms:while:arrivals:)"],"title":"Moving an actor","anchor":"Moving-an-actor"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/steals(_:daemonName:candidates:chancePerTurn:announcement:)"],"title":"Taking things","anchor":"Taking-things"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/reaction(of:to:reply:)"],"title":"Answering the player","anchor":"Answering-the-player"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustoactors"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An actor who stands where the author put him is scenery with a name on it. Four"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"factories here cover the behaviors that make one feel like a person in the room:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"he moves around a set of rooms on his own, he keeps up with the player, he takes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"things, and he has something to say when spoken to."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors","isActive":true},{"text":" is a ","type":"text"},{"code":"GamePlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which here means it owns nothing at all —"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"no entities, no "},{"code":"@Global","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", no saved state. An actor’s position ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"is","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" his"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"placement, which the engine already saves. So the plugin is never listed in"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"content","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; it is stored as a plain property, and the host splices the return","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values into its own blocks. The three daemon factories return a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TimedEvent"},{"type":"text","text":" for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timers"},{"type":"text","text":" block; "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/reaction(of:to:reply:)"},{"text":" returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"Rules","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"code":"rules","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" block. Everything they act on — the actor, the room set, the loot,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the prose — is handed in by the host."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Randomness is drawn only after a factory’s guards pass. A roaming daemon whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"actor is out of position, or a thief whose player has nothing worth taking,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"consumes no randomness at all, so a seeded transcript that never meets the actor"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stays stable no matter what he gets up to elsewhere. "},{"code":"while:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:daemonName:rooms:chancePerTurn:while:arrival:departure:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/follows(_:daemonName:rooms:while:arrivals:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is evaluated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before the position guard for the same reason: a shut gate is a quiet, draw-free"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"turn."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"None of these daemons acts for an actor whose "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Actor.isUnconscious"},{"text":" is set. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"man lying on the floor does not wander off, catch you up, or lift anything out of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"your hands, and he draws no randomness deciding not to. The flag is the engine’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than this plugin’s because what usually puts a villain down is a combat"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plugin, and two plugins cannot see each other: "},{"code":"GnustoMeleeCombat","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" sets it and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this one reads it, with neither library knowing the other exists."}]},{"level":2,"text":"Wiring","type":"heading","anchor":"Wiring"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import Gnusto","import GnustoActors","","struct Gallery: Game {","    let title = \"Gallery\"","    let actors = ActorBehaviors()","","    let thief = Actor { name(\"shadowy figure\"); synonyms(\"thief\", \"figure\") }","    let painting = Item { name(\"oil painting\"); adjectives(\"oil\") }","    let cellar = Location { name(\"Cellar\"); description(\"…\") }","    let studio = Location { name(\"Studio\"); description(\"…\") }","","    var timers: [TimedEvent] {","        actors.roams(","            thief,","            daemonName: \"thief.roam\",","            rooms: [cellar, studio],","            chancePerTurn: 50,","            arrival: \"A shadow detaches itself from the doorway.\",","            departure: \"The shadow is somewhere else, and you did not see it go.\")","        actors.steals(","            thief,","            daemonName: \"thief.steal\",","            candidates: [painting],","            chancePerTurn: 30,","            announcement: { \"A hand you never see relieves you of the \\($0).\" })","    }","","    var rules: Rules {","        actors.reaction(of: thief, to: [.give, .attack], reply: \"The figure is not there when you reach it.\")","    }","","    var map: WorldMap { … }","}"]},{"level":2,"text":"Roaming and following are different daemons","type":"heading","anchor":"Roaming-and-following-are-different-daemons"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:daemonName:rooms:chancePerTurn:while:arrival:departure:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"teleports the actor within a room set, with no exit-graph awareness — a wall"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"between two rooms in the set will not stop him. It has both an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"arrival"},{"text":" and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"departure"},{"type":"text","text":" line, because the player can be standing in either room."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/follows(_:daemonName:rooms:while:arrivals:)"},{"type":"text","text":" moves the actor to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wherever the player now stands. Daemons tick at the end of the turn, after "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"go"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has resolved and the new room has been described, so the companion catches up on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same turn and his arrival line trails the room description. There is no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"departure","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" line, because he only ever moves "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"toward"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" the player and nobody is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"left behind to watch him go. He draws no randomness whatever: "},{"code":"arrivals","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cycled by the saved turn counter, so the line varies from arrival to arrival and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stays identical across a save and restore. Pass one line for a fixed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"announcement, or a dozen so a constant companion does not wear his welcome out."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Both prose channels are gated on light. In the dark, or a room away, the movement","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is silent.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two ways to scope a follower, and they scope different things. "},{"code":"rooms:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whitelist of "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"destinations"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — a gaoler who walks the corridors and will not set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"foot in a cell follows you along the one and lets you go into the other, which is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what makes “somewhere he will not go” a place you can stand. "},{"code":"while:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"gate, for the companion who has been told to wait. ","type":"text"},{"code":"stopDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parks him","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"where he stands and ","type":"text"},{"code":"startDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" picks him up again; ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sources\/KindlyDeep\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"turns its whole endgame on which room the mule was standing in when he was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parked.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Start a follower co-located with the player and there is no spurious arrival on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"turn one."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"The-thief-takes-from-anywhere-in-the-room","text":"The thief takes from anywhere in the room","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/steals(_:daemonName:candidates:chancePerTurn:announcement:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lifts a candidate from wherever it lies in the shared room: out of the player’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"hands, off the floor, or from inside anything open, to any depth. Only another","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"actor’s hands are out of reach. The theft is announced only when the room is lit;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in the dark you find out when you check your pockets.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Worked-examples","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Worked examples"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sources\/Lighthouse\/"},{"type":"text","text":" has a keeper who roams two rooms stacked on a staircase."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sources\/KindlyDeep\/"},{"type":"text","text":" has the follow-park-rejoin cycle in full, and its design"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"docs\/games\/kindly-deep.md"},{"type":"text","text":") is where the reasoning lives."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sources\/Zork1\/"},{"type":"text","text":" runs the thief: roaming the whole underground, stealing from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"treasure roster, and fighting back only in his own lair."}]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Daemons that make an NPC wander, tag along, or go through your pockets."}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors":{"kind":"symbol","title":"GnustoActors","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors","abstract":[{"text":"Daemons that make an NPC wander, tag along, or go through your pockets.","type":"text"}]},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/steals(_:daemonName:candidates:chancePerTurn:announcement:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/steals(_:daemonName:candidates:chancePerTurn:announcement:)","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/steals(_:daemonname:candidates:chanceperturn:announcement:)","type":"topic","title":"steals(_:daemonName:candidates:chancePerTurn:announcement:)","abstract":[{"text":"A daemon that, when ","type":"text"},{"code":"actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" shares the player’s room, rolls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"chancePerTurn"},{"type":"text","text":" and moves one random "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"reachable"}]},{"type":"text","text":" item from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"candidates"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"into the actor’s inventory, announcing it with the stolen item’s name."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Like the original’s thief, the actor lifts a candidate from wherever it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lies in the shared room: out of the player’s hands, off the floor, or"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from inside anything open — a sack, a trophy case, a table top — to any","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"depth. Only another actor’s hands are beyond reach. The theft is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"announced only when the player’s room is lit: in the dark you find out"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when you check your pockets."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"steals","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Actor"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"daemonName"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"candidates","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV","text":"Item"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"chancePerTurn"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"announcement"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TimedEvent","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/init()":{"kind":"symbol","title":"init()","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/init()","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/init()","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Creates the plugin.","type":"text"}]},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ActorBehaviors","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"ActorBehaviors","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ActorBehaviors"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Logic-only NPC behaviors: roaming, theft, canned reactions. The plugin","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"owns no entities and no state — position "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"is"}]},{"text":" the actor’s placement —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the host declares its actors and splices these factories into its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"own ","type":"text"},{"code":"timers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rules"},{"type":"text","text":" blocks:"}]},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/roams(_:daemonName:rooms:chancePerTurn:while:arrival:departure:)":{"kind":"symbol","title":"roams(_:daemonName:rooms:chancePerTurn:while:arrival:departure:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:daemonName:rooms:chancePerTurn:while:arrival:departure:)","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/roams(_:daemonname:rooms:chanceperturn:while:arrival:departure:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"roams","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Actor","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"text":"daemonName","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"rooms"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Location","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8LocationV"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"text":"chancePerTurn","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"while","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"arrival","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"text":"departure","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"?) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A daemon that, with "},{"code":"chancePerTurn","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", moves ","type":"text"},{"code":"actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to a random","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"other","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" room in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rooms"},{"type":"text","text":" — a teleport within the set, with no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"exit-graph awareness (a wall between two rooms in the set won’t","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stop him). Arrival\/departure lines print only when the player’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"room is lit and is the room being entered or left: in the dark, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a room away, movement is silent. The daemon idles (no RNG drawn)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"while the actor is outside "},{"code":"rooms","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — including after ","type":"text"},{"code":"vanish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"but the host should still ","type":"text"},{"code":"stopDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on the actor’s death."}]},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/reaction(of:to:reply:)":{"kind":"symbol","title":"reaction(of:to:reply:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/reaction(of:to:reply:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/reaction(of:to:reply:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reaction"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"of"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Actor"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"to"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto6IntentV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Intent"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"reply"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Rules","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5RulesV"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A canned reply when any of the named intents target the actor —","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"“talk to troll”, “give sword to troll”, whatever the host’s verbs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"emit. One line, before-phase, ends the turn.","type":"text"}]},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/follows(_:daemonName:rooms:while:arrivals:)":{"kind":"symbol","title":"follows(_:daemonName:rooms:while:arrivals:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/follows(_:daemonname:rooms:while:arrivals:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/follows(_:daemonName:rooms:while:arrivals:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"follows"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","text":"Actor"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"daemonName"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rooms","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8LocationV","text":"Location","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"while"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"text":"arrivals","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"]) -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A daemon that keeps ","type":"text"},{"code":"actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in the player’s room: each turn, if the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"actor is onstage but elsewhere, it teleports to wherever the player","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"now stands. Daemons tick at the end of the turn, after the player’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"go","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has resolved and the new room is described, so the companion","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"catches up the same turn and its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"arrival"},{"type":"text","text":" line trails the room"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"description. The line prints only when the destination is lit: in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the dark the companion arrives unseen. There is deliberately no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"departure","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" line — the companion only ever moves ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"to","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" the player,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so no one is ever in the room it leaves to watch it go (unlike","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"roams","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). The daemon idles while the actor is offstage — including","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vanish()"},{"type":"text","text":" — and the host may "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stopDaemon(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" to park the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"companion for a “wait here” beat, then ","type":"text"},{"code":"startDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to resume.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It draws no randomness at all (unlike ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"roams"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"steals","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"following companion never perturbs the seeded stream: ","type":"text"},{"code":"arrivals","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cycled by the saved turn counter, so the line varies from arrival to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"arrival yet stays deterministic across save and restore. Pass one","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"line for a fixed announcement, a dozen so a constant companion does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not wear his welcome out. Start the companion co-located with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"starts(in:)"},{"type":"text","text":" the player’s start room) to avoid a spurious"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrival on turn one."}]}}}